{"id":"0ed90ae4603ff58f6e170fed51ea23bbda11cf6f","axis":"silent","repo":"supabase/supabase","sha":"0ed90ae4603ff58f6e170fed51ea23bbda11cf6f","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"apps/design-system/content/docs/components/button.mdx","lines":["@@ -128,14 +128,21 @@ When secondary actions are related but distinct (not alternatives to the primary"," "," <ComponentPreview name=\"button-split-dropdown\" peekCode />"," ","-Ensure the middle border is shared rather than doubled-up. Do not use `border-l-0` on the chevron button as that drops the divider on hover/focus. Instead:","+For the default variant, wrap the button and its chevron trigger in `SplitButtonGroup`. To name the group for screen readers, pass an `aria-label` to it."," ","-- Primary action: `rounded-r-none` and `hover:z-10` so its border stacks above the chevron on hover.","-- Chevron trigger: `rounded-l-none`, `shrink-0`, `px-[4px] py-[5px]`, and `-ml-px` to overlap the adjacent border by one pixel.","-- Both: `focus-visible:z-10` so the focus ring stacks above the neighbour, and `focus-visible:rounded-r-sm` / `focus-visible:rounded-l-sm` so the squared-off edge is slightly rounded while the ring is shown.","-- Chevron trigger only: `aria-label` describing the menu (the icon is decorative).","+Give the chevron trigger `shrink-0` and `px-1 py-1.25`. The chevron icon is decorative, so also give the trigger an `aria-label` that names the menu."," ","-Inside [Admonition](../fragments/admonition#split-button-with-dropdown) actions when `layout=\"responsive\"`: also use `flex w-full @lg:w-auto` with `flex-1 @lg:flex-none` on the primary action.","+The `primary`, `danger`, and `warning` variants have an opaque fill, so they use per-button classes in place of `SplitButtonGroup`. Add `rounded-r-none hover:z-10` to the primary action and `rounded-l-none -ml-px` to the chevron trigger.","+","+In [Admonition](../fragments/admonition#split-button-with-dropdown) actions with `layout=\"responsive\"`, add `w-full @lg:w-auto` to `SplitButtonGroup` and `flex-1 @lg:flex-none` to the primary action.","+","+`SplitButtonGroup` renders a `role=\"group\"` wrapper with the `raised-control-group` utility, which changes the default-variant buttons in these ways:","+","+- It squares the inner corners and rounds them slightly while the focus ring shows.","+- It overlaps the buttons by one pixel, and only one button paints that shared column. Under the translucent dark fill, a plain `-ml-px` overlap stacks both edges and makes the divider look heavier.","+- It lets the hovered button paint the shared column, so the divider matches that button's edge color. At rest, the chevron trigger paints it.","+- It lifts the focused button above its neighbor.","+- It keeps the primary action from shrinking on press."," "," ## Default fill and floating buttons"," "],"additions":13,"deletions":6,"truncated":false},{"path":"apps/design-system/registry/default/example/admonition-button-split.tsx","lines":["@@ -5,6 +5,7 @@ import {","   DropdownMenuContent,","   DropdownMenuItem,","   DropdownMenuTrigger,","+  SplitButtonGroup,"," } from 'ui'"," import { Admonition } from 'ui-patterns/Admonition'"," ","@@ -16,11 +17,8 @@ export default function AdmonitionButtonSplitDemo() {","       title=\"Set up custom SMTP to edit templates\"","       description=\"Emails will be sent using the default templates. Set up custom SMTP to edit their subject and body.\"","       actions={","-        <div className=\"flex w-full @lg:w-auto\">","-          <Button","-            type=\"button\"","-            className=\"flex-1 rounded-r-none px-3 @lg:flex-none hover:z-10 focus-visible:z-10 focus-visible:rounded-r-sm\"","-          >","+        <SplitButtonGroup className=\"w-full @lg:w-auto\">","+          <Button type=\"button\" className=\"flex-1 px-3 @lg:flex-none\">","             Set up SMTP","           </Button>","           <DropdownMenu>","@@ -28,7 +26,7 @@ export default function AdmonitionButtonSplitDemo() {","               <Butto